		openMarinkaRodeo.vim installation + auto filetype detection
	-----------------------------------------------------------

* Place "openMarinkaRodeo.vim" in ~/.vim/syntax/openMarinkaRodeo.vim

* Enable auto filetype detection in your ~/.vimrc with the following two lines:

set filetype=on
au BufNewFile,BufRead *openMarinkaRodeo*.cfg,*.{os,oMarinkaRodeo,openMarinkaRodeo} set filetype=openMarinkaRodeo


For any questions / suggestions, please write us at:
users@lists.openMarinkaRodeo.org
